WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.290
Prop crews: unloading, the prop area, and loading.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:10.410
Your assignment picks the screen you open on. Moved to another job? Switch screens up here.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:16.170
Every school, in performance order. Tap a school when its props come in the prop door.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.599
Every tap asks first.

00:00:18.799 --> 00:00:25.490
School has no props or tarp crew today? Tap this instead. It greys out on every prop screen.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:31.960
Done schools grey out, with the time and who tapped. Wrong one? Tap it, and take it back.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:39.424
In the prop area, each school shows its next step: in holding, then staged at warm-up, by the time shown.

00:00:39.624 --> 00:00:42.920
After that, it follows the guard to the floor.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:50.740
Loading lights up a school when its guide heads back to the home room. Tap it once the props are loaded and gone.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:59.880
Thanks, prop crew. Keep the screen open. It refreshes by itself, and taps made with no signal send when it comes back.
